    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re an enthusiastic hobby gardener, you can tell apples from oranges, you like your harden, and you love growing vegetables and more?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then team up with the cute and quirky gnomes of Molehill Empire 2 on your way from a self-sufficient gardener to an international supplier of sustainable and organic products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288350/extras/f251fec0c3ec886fdfefa906dbedd48d.avif?t=1748944406\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOLEHILL EMPIRE 2 \u2013 MORE THAN JUST A FLOWERBED!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gardening with a green thumb: alone or in a team \u2013 there\u2019s always plenty to do!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op and communication: a built-in messenger helps you trade with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research and field work: Discover new plants and upgrade your garden</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heirlooms and achievements: Collect accolades and trophies to impress your friend</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ORGANIC GARDENING GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Molehill Empire 2, you\u2019ll experience a skillful blend of garden game, hilarious and quirky moments, and a complex tycoon right in the comfort of your garden plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sow, harvest, and sell crops; research new cultivation methods, and unlock new plants. Conquer the top of the world \u2013 alone or with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288350/extras/73c0672866806984c3ce2be266136eef.avif?t=1748944406\" width=450 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRADE AND GROW: YOUR EMPIRE IS FLOURISHING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way to the top is not always easy. That\u2019s why teamwork is of utmost importance in the Molehill Empire app. Even the most clever gnome could sometimes use a helping hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends to trade, chat, and have fun with you. In this engaging community game, helping each other is the best part!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Molehill Empire 2 app cannot be linked with your Molehill Empire browser game account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Molehill Empire was funded in part by the FilmFernsehFonds (FFF) Bayern.</p>",
