0672866806984c3ce2be266136eef.avif?t=1748944406\" width=450 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRADE AND GROW: YOUR EMPIRE IS FLOURISHING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way to the top is not always easy. That\u2019s why teamwork is of utmost importance in the Molehill Empire app. Even the most clever gnome could sometimes use a helping hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends to trade, chat, and have fun with you. In this engaging community game, helping each other is the best part!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Molehill Empire 2 app cannot be linked with your Molehill Empire browser game account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Molehill Empire was funded in part by the FilmFernsehFonds (FFF) Bayern.</p>",
